# Trims what `fly deploy`/`docker build` upload as build context from this
# repo root - every infra/cloud/Dockerfile.* COPY's only the specific
# top-level packages it needs (see each Dockerfile's own COPY list), so
# none of them need the entries below, which is most of this repo's actual
# on-disk size (see DEPLOYMENT.md's troubleshooting section for the "Build
# context is 1.0 GB" warning this fixes).
#
# frontend/node_modules and frontend/.next are excluded, not all of
# frontend/ - infra/cloud/Dockerfile.frontend still needs the rest of
# frontend/ (package.json, app/, components/, lib/, etc.) for its own
# `npm ci && npm run build` inside the image; it never wants the host's
# already-installed node_modules or a stale local .next build copied in.

.venv/
.git/
data/
mini_faire.egg-info/
_to_delete/
DoNOTpUSH.txt

__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.next/
